At this fair value, a half-spread of about 3 to 4 earns roughly +0.36 to +0.48 per quote in expectation. The gain from noise traders outweighs the loss to informed traders at that width. A tight spread of about 1.5 only roughly breaks even. I'm quoting around 3.3 each side of fair value.

