I estimate the fair value at 11.5. Die 1 averages 5 and the loaded die 2 averages 6.5. The settlement standard deviation is about 4.7.

With half the counterparties informed, I need a wide spread to cover adverse selection. In my rough normal approximation, the expected profit from an ask stays near +0.2 per quote for asks between about 16 and 18. The ask is close to break-even at 15 and loses money at 13. I quote roughly symmetrically around 11.5 and tighten slightly from the last quote, which got no trade.

