I enumerated all 36 possible pairs for the last two cards and compared the loss to an informed trader with the gain from a noise trader at each price. Expected profit per quote is roughly flat around +0.1 for asks of about 28 to 31 and bids of about 13 to 15. Outside those ranges it falls toward zero or goes negative. I'm quoting inside those ranges.

