I checked expected profit per quote across a range of bids and asks. Informed traders hit the extremes (value 70 on the ask side, 30 to 50 on the bid side), so quotes close to fair value lose to them. Expected profit on the ask side is roughly flat from 75 to 81 at about 2.7 to 2.9, and on the bid side it peaks around 38 to 40 at about 2.7. I'm already long 2, so I lean slightly toward selling by keeping the ask tighter than the bid is deep.

