I'm at -3, so I can only bid. A bid close to fair value mostly invites informed sellers who know the coin came up low. Lowering the bid raises my edge per trade, but fewer counterparties will hit it. Each fill also moves me to -2 and re-opens my ask side, which has been earning edge. I'll bid at 3.2, a moderate discount to fair value.

